title: "Session host: one channel across dcserver restarts, host loss and terminate"
---
stateDiagram-v2
  state "Legend" as legend {
    lg0: Recovery
    lg1: Session
    lg2: Path to the HostRecovers bug
    lg3: Repeats forever, so HostRecovers breaks
  }
  class lg0 blue
  class lg1 teal
  class lg2 bugPath
  class lg3 repeats
  s0: No session
  s1: No session, a message waiting
  s2: Creating, a message waiting
  s3: Creating, host server down, a message waiting
  s4: dcserver down, nothing running, host server down, a message waiting
  s5: Boot reconcile, host server down, a message waiting (after the restart)
  s6: Pending, awaiting the host census, host server down (after the restart)
  s7: No session, host server down, a message waiting (after the restart)
  s8: Input refused, no session, host server down (after the restart)
  s9: Input refused, no session, host server down (after the restart) (no more messages)
  [*] --> s0
  s0 --> s0: a host probe stops failing
  s0 --> s1: a message arrives
  s1 --> s2: a message reserves a new execution
  s2 --> s3: the host server ends
  s3 --> s4: dcserver stops
  s4 --> s5: dcserver starts
  s5 --> s6: intake opens
  s6 --> s7: the census finds nothing and closes the row
  s7 --> s8: the message is refused before any spawn
  s8 --> s7: a message arrives
  s7 --> s9: the message is refused before any spawn
